      "description": "The text 'karen' at the top of the image is explicitly mapped onto the visual entity of the cat. The cat's exaggerated posture and expression — standing on hind legs, paws raised, mouth open as if screaming — are used as a visual metaphor to represent the 'karen' stereotype. This mapping is central to the meme's intent, equating the cat's angry expression with the perceived behavior of a 'karen'.",
